{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Shopping Spree", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Shopaholic", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in music and fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about fashion.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "  Superlatives and Comparatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "  You use <span class=\"strong\">comparative adjectives</span> to make a comparison between two things or two people. When you make a comparison, you should use the word <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">than</span></span> after the <span class=\"strong\">comparative adjective</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Examples: <br> <span class=\"italic\">She is tall<span class=\"strong\">er than</span> me. <br> The library is old<span class=\"strong\">er than</span> the museum.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With one syllable words, you add <span class=\"strong\">-er</span> to the adjective to make the <span class=\"strong\">comparative form</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The best places are on Rose or Trinity. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They have the coolest little shops!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They're the priciest too!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You want to be the smartest looking writer, right!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cheap\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cheap<span class=\\\"strong\\\">er</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"new\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"new<span class=\\\"strong\\\">er</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tall\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tall<span class=\\\"strong\\\">er</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "With  <span class=\"strong\">adjectives</span> of two or more syllables, you add the word <span class=\"strong\"> <span class=\"italic\">more</span></span> before the adjective.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective                    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expensive                   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> more</span>  expensive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"interesting                   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">more</span> interesting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" difficult   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> more </span> difficult\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can compare things using the words more (than) or less (than). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">superlative adjectives</span> to compare one thing or person among two or more things or people. When you make a comparison using the <span class=\"strong\">superlative form</span>, you should use the word <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">the </span></span>before the <span class=\"strong\">superlative adjective</span> . ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples: <br>  <span class=\"italic\">She is <span class=\"strong\">the tallest</span>  in her class. <br> The library is<span class=\"strong\"> the oldest</span> building at the school.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With one syllable <span class=\"strong\">adjective</span> , you add <span class=\"strong\">-est</span>  to the <span class=\"strong\">adjective</span>  to make the <span class=\"strong\">superlative form</span> . ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective                    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cheap                           \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the cheap<span class=\\\"strong\\\">est</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"new                              \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the new<span class=\\\"strong\\\">est</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tall                                \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the tall<span class=\\\"strong\\\">est</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "With <span class=\"strong\">adjectives</span> of two or more syllables, you add the words <span class=\"strong\">the most</span> before the <span class=\"strong\">adjective</span> .", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective                    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expensive                    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">the most</span>  expensive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"interesting  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">the most</span>  interesting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"difficult                        \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">the most</span>  difficult\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Language for Comparing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When shopping, it is common to describe products or items by talking about particular qualities or features that they have.<br/><br/>It is also common to compare ourselves and the way we look in a garment.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A comparative adjective is used to compare two people, places, ideas or things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When comparing two items that are equal, we use the form <span class=\"italic\">as + adjective + as.</span><br/>Examples:<br/><span class=\"italic\">This shop isn't <span class=\"strong\">as trendy as</span> the other one we went into.<br/>This sweater doesn't look <span class=\"strong\">as good</span> on me <span class=\"strong\">as</span> the other one.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "My clothes don't fit as well as they used to! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We haven't gone shopping as often as we did in college.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I don't want to look as old and stuffy as the other women. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I guess I can't afford to dress as cheaply as I used to. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wardrobe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the clothing a person wears", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to add some new clothing to my wardrobe. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "overhaul", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to change and improve", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  My wardrobe needs an overhaul.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "purchase", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you have bought ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My most recent purchases are months old. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to step up your game", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to compete at a higher level", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to step up my game at work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "uniform", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clothing worn for certain jobs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm always in my work uniform.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "stuffy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "formal; old-fashioned", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't want to look as old and stuffy as the other women.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "two-piece suit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pants and a jacket or pants and a skirt made of the same fabric", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The men all wear two-piece suits to work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to reinvent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do something new based on what already exists ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I feel like I have to reinvent my look. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "look", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way you present yourself fashion-wise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Stars have to reinvent their look every year to stay current.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Find two pictures of two differently dressed people from a fashion magazine or online.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the differences between the clothes the people are wearing  (use as much clothing vocabulary as you can). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph of 100 words describing and comparing the clothes in the pictures.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use comparative adjectives and <span class=\"italic\">(not) as ... as</span>.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I describe differences between the clothes people are wearing in two pictures.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use clothing vocabulary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write using comparisons.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le07ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We have got to go out shopping. My clothes don't fit as well as they used to! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, my wardrobe needs an overhaul. My most recent purchases are months old now. We haven't gone shopping as often as we did in college.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We're busier now. I also think we're more careful with our money. It's harder to spend a lot when you put in so many hours making it."}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "21000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I just don't feel I look as fashionable as the other woman in the office. I have to step up my game.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm always in my work clothes. Uniforms are great. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I need a couple of two piece suits or some more interesting tops and more expensive pants. I feel like I have to reinvent my look. I don't want to look as old and stuffy as the other woman. Their clothes are no fun!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Maybe we can find a balance for you \u2013 clothing that's a little more business-like but trendier."}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob01re2img02.jpg", "time": "48500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That would be perfect. I need sweaters, skirts, blouses, dresses and of course shoes!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ok. The best places are on Rose or Trinity. They have the coolest little shops!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: They're the priciest too!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You want to be the smartest looking writer, right!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I guess I can't afford to dress as cheaply as I used to.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Grab your coat, Sally. We're going shopping!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le07ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le07ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about clothing.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can compare two things or people and describe the quality of an object or a person.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can make comparisons using <span class=\"italic\">as ... as</span> and <span class=\"italic\">not as</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you always shop in the same place or do you try different places? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What attracts you to a store? The styles? The price? The quality? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "It's time to go shopping!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">Grab your coat</span>, Sally!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\u201cGrab your coat\u201d</span> means let's get moving, it's time to leave!", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct":